{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-8136","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8020","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8021","text":" — Graph-Structured Memory Capability"}]},{"id":"blk-8137","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8022","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8023","text":" is a concrete capability page for the [&] Protocol's "},{"id":"spn-8024","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-8025","text":" primitive."}]},{"id":"blk-8138","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8026","text":"It describes the capability interface for "},{"id":"spn-8027","marks":["bold"],"text":"graph-structured memory"},{"id":"spn-8028","text":": a memory system that stores entities, events, concepts, and relationships in a connected form and can use that structure to enrich retrieval, support reasoning, and preserve durable context over time."}]},{"id":"blk-8139","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8029","text":"This page is part of the capability registry and documentation hub. It is intended to be useful both to humans and to downstream generation systems."}]},{"id":"blk-8140","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8030","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8141","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8031","text":"1. Definition"}]},{"id":"blk-8142","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8032","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8033","text":" is the capability for:"}]},{"id":"blk-8143","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8145","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8034","text":"relationship-aware recall"}]}],"id":"blk-8144","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8147","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8035","text":"graph-linked context enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-8146","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8149","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8036","text":"durable structured memory"}]}],"id":"blk-8148","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8151","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8037","text":"consolidation of repeated observations into connected knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-8150","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8153","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8038","text":"retrieval over entities, events, dependencies, and incident structure"}]}],"id":"blk-8152","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8039","text":"Unlike flat text retrieval alone, graph memory preserves "},{"id":"spn-8040","marks":["bold"],"text":"how things relate"},{"id":"spn-8041","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-8155","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8042","text":"That makes it especially useful when an agent must answer questions like:"}]},{"id":"blk-8156","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8043","text":"What other incidents are connected to this one?"}]}],"id":"blk-8157","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8160","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8044","text":"Which dependency chain links this failure to a prior outage?"}]}],"id":"blk-8159","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8045","text":"Which entities, regions, or customers are affected through known relationships?"}]}],"id":"blk-8161","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8164","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8046","text":"What prior action led to this current state?"}]}],"id":"blk-8163","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8047","text":"In protocol terms, the canonical capability identifier is:"}]},{"id":"blk-8166","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8048","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"}]}],"id":"blk-8167","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8049","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8170","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8050","text":"2. Why this capability exists"}]},{"id":"blk-8171","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8051","text":"A large share of important agent workloads are not just about finding similar text. They are about traversing structure."}]},{"id":"blk-8172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8052","text":"Examples:"}]},{"id":"blk-8173","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8053","text":"infrastructure incidents linked through services, hosts, and dependencies"}]}],"id":"blk-8174","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8177","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8054","text":"research concepts linked through claims, citations, and prior conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-8176","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8179","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8055","text":"customer support cases linked through account history, policies, and prior escalations"}]}],"id":"blk-8178","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8181","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8056","text":"fraud investigations linked through entities, accounts, devices, and event chains"}]}],"id":"blk-8180","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8182","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8057","text":"A graph memory capability is useful whenever:"}]},{"id":"blk-8183","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8058","text":"1. relationship structure matters 2. recall should be explainable 3. enrichment should include linked context rather than only nearest-neighbor similarity 4. memory should consolidate into durable connected knowledge over time"}]},{"id":"blk-8184","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8059","text":"This is why "},{"id":"spn-8060","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8061","text":" is a distinct capability rather than just a provider detail."}]},{"id":"blk-8185","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8062","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8186","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8063","text":"3. Capability family position"}]},{"id":"blk-8187","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8064","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8065","text":" sits inside the "},{"id":"spn-8066","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-8067","text":" namespace."}]},{"id":"blk-8188","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8068","text":"Related memory capabilities include:"}]},{"id":"blk-8189","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8191","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8069","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8070","text":" — semantic retrieval over embedded content"}]}],"id":"blk-8190","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8193","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8071","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8072","text":" — replayable prior experiences or sessions"}]}],"id":"blk-8192","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8194","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8073","text":"A useful shorthand:"}]},{"id":"blk-8195","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8197","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8074","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8075","text":" = connected durable knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-8196","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8076","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8077","text":" = semantic similarity retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-8198","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8201","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8078","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8079","text":" = prior experience replay"}]}],"id":"blk-8200","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8202","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8080","text":"In many real systems, these capabilities compose rather than compete."}]},{"id":"blk-8203","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8081","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8204","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8082","text":"4. Capability contract summary"}]},{"id":"blk-8205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8083","text":"Below is a representative contract for "},{"id":"spn-8084","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8085","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-8206","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8086","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/capability-contract.schema.json\", \"capability\": \"&memory.graph\", \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"description\": \"Graph-structured memory contract for relationship-aware recall, enrichment, and consolidation across incident, research, and operational contexts.\", \"operations\": { \"recall\": { \"in\": \"query_context\", \"out\": \"memory_hits\", \"description\": \"Retrieve graph-linked facts, incidents, entities, and relationships relevant to the current query.\", \"deterministic\": false, \"side_effects\": false }, \"learn\": { \"in\": \"observation\", \"out\": \"ack\", \"description\": \"Persist a new observation or derived relationship into graph memory.\", \"deterministic\": true, \"side_effects\": true }, \"consolidate\": { \"in\": \"memory_batch\", \"out\": \"graph_update\", \"description\": \"Merge repeated observations into more durable graph structure.\", \"deterministic\": false, \"side_effects\": true }, \"enrich\": { \"in\": \"anomaly_set\", \"out\": \"enriched_context\", \"description\": \"Add linked historical incidents, dependencies, or related entities to a current anomaly set.\", \"deterministic\": false, \"side_effects\": false } }, \"accepts_from\": [ \"&time.*\", \"&reason.*\", \"query_context\", \"observation\", \"memory_batch\" ], \"feeds_into\": [ \"&reason.*\", \"&space.*\", \"output\" ], \"a2a_skills\": [ \"graph-memory-recall\", \"context-enrichment\", \"memory-consolidation\" ] } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8207","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8087","text":"Interpretation"}]},{"id":"blk-8208","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8088","text":"This contract says that "},{"id":"spn-8089","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8090","text":" can:"}]},{"id":"blk-8209","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8211","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8091","text":"recall graph-linked knowledge from a query context"}]}],"id":"blk-8210","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8213","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8092","text":"learn new observations"}]}],"id":"blk-8212","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8215","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8093","text":"consolidate batches into stronger graph structure"}]}],"id":"blk-8214","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8217","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8094","text":"enrich anomaly-oriented or operational context for downstream reasoning"}]}],"id":"blk-8216","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8095","text":"It also says that it composes especially naturally with:"}]},{"id":"blk-8219","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8221","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8096","text":"temporal capabilities upstream"}]}],"id":"blk-8220","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8097","text":"reasoning capabilities downstream"}]}],"id":"blk-8222","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8225","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8098","text":"spatial capabilities downstream"}]}],"id":"blk-8224","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8226","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8099","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8227","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8100","text":"5. Operations"}]},{"id":"blk-8228","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8101","marks":["code"],"text":"recall"}]},{"id":"blk-8229","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8102","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-8230","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8232","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8103","text":"retrieve relevant nodes, edges, and linked context"}]}],"id":"blk-8231","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8233","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8104","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-8234","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8236","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8105","marks":["code"],"text":"query_context"}]}],"id":"blk-8235","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8237","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8106","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-8238","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8240","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8107","marks":["code"],"text":"memory_hits"}]}],"id":"blk-8239","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8241","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8108","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-8242","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8244","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8109","text":"the agent needs graph-aware recall instead of plain document search"}]}],"id":"blk-8243","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8245","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8110","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"}]},{"id":"blk-8246","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8111","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-8247","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8249","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8112","text":"store new observations or relationship updates"}]}],"id":"blk-8248","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8250","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8113","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-8251","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8253","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8114","marks":["code"],"text":"observation"}]}],"id":"blk-8252","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8254","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8115","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-8255","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8257","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8116","marks":["code"],"text":"ack"}]}],"id":"blk-8256","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8258","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8117","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-8259","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8261","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8118","text":"the agent should update durable memory after a task or decision"}]}],"id":"blk-8260","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8262","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8119","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"}]},{"id":"blk-8263","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8120","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-8264","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8266","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8121","text":"merge repeated or fragmented knowledge into more stable graph structure"}]}],"id":"blk-8265","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8267","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8122","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-8268","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8270","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8123","marks":["code"],"text":"memory_batch"}]}],"id":"blk-8269","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8271","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8124","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-8272","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8274","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8125","marks":["code"],"text":"graph_update"}]}],"id":"blk-8273","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8275","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8126","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-8276","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8278","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8127","text":"the system accumulates many observations and needs durable structure"}]}],"id":"blk-8277","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8279","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8128","marks":["code"],"text":"enrich"}]},{"id":"blk-8280","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8129","text":"Purpose:"}]},{"id":"blk-8281","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8283","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8130","text":"attach graph-linked historical or dependency context to an existing payload"}]}],"id":"blk-8282","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8284","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8131","text":"Typical input:"}]},{"id":"blk-8285","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8287","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8132","marks":["code"],"text":"anomaly_set"},{"id":"spn-8133","text":" or compatible context object"}]}],"id":"blk-8286","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8288","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8134","text":"Typical output:"}]},{"id":"blk-8289","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8291","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8135","marks":["code"],"text":"enriched_context"}]}],"id":"blk-8290","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8292","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8136","text":"Use when:"}]},{"id":"blk-8293","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8295","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8137","text":"another capability has already produced a signal and graph memory should make it more useful"}]}],"id":"blk-8294","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8296","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8138","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8297","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8139","text":"6. Architecture patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-8298","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8140","text":"Pattern A: anomaly enrichment"}]},{"id":"blk-8299","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8141","text":"~~~text stream_data"}]},{"id":"blk-8300","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8142","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8301","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8143","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-8302","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8144","text":"1. a temporal capability detects anomalies 2. graph memory adds linked incident and dependency context 3. reasoning evaluates the best action"}]},{"id":"blk-8303","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8145","text":"This is one of the strongest "},{"id":"spn-8146","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8147","text":" patterns."}]},{"id":"blk-8304","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8148","text":"Pattern B: research knowledge graph"}]},{"id":"blk-8305","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8149","text":"~~~text research_query"}]},{"id":"blk-8306","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8150","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8307","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8151","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-8308","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8152","text":"1. graph memory retrieves claims, relationships, and prior linked knowledge 2. reasoning compares or synthesizes evidence"}]},{"id":"blk-8309","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8153","text":"Pattern C: learning from outcomes"}]},{"id":"blk-8310","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8154","text":"~~~text decision_outcome"}]},{"id":"blk-8311","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8155","text":"~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8312","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8156","text":"What happens:"}]},{"id":"blk-8313","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8157","text":"1. outcome evidence is added to graph memory 2. repeated or related observations are consolidated"}]},{"id":"blk-8314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8158","text":"This supports continual learning without discarding structure."}]},{"id":"blk-8315","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8159","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8316","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8160","text":"7. Architecture diagram"}]},{"id":"blk-8317","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8161","text":"A simple mental model for "},{"id":"spn-8162","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8163","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-8318","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8164","text":"~~~text ┌─────────────────────┐ │   incoming signal   │ │  query / anomaly /  │ │     observation     │ └─────────┬───────────┘ │ ▼ ┌─────────────────────┐ │   &memory.graph     │ │                     │ │  - recall           │ │  - enrich           │ │  - learn            │ │  - consolidate      │ └─────────┬───────────┘ │ ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐ │              │              │ ▼              ▼              ▼ ┌────────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌───────────────┐ │ enriched       │ │ graph update │ │ memory hits   │ │ context        │ │ / ack        │ │ / linked facts│ └──────┬─────────┘ └──────────────┘ └───────────────┘ │ ▼ ┌─────────────────────┐ │ downstream reason / │ │ space / output flow │ └─────────────────────┘ ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8319","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8165","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8320","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8166","text":"8. Example declaration"}]},{"id":"blk-8321","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8167","text":"A concrete "},{"id":"spn-8168","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-8169","text":" fragment:"}]},{"id":"blk-8322","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8170","text":"~~~json { \"&memory.graph\": { \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"infra-ops\" } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8323","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8171","text":"A fuller declaration:"}]},{"id":"blk-8324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8172","text":"~~~json { \"$schema\": \"https://protocol.ampersandboxdesign.com/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json\", \"agent\": \"InfraOperator\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"capabilities\": { \"&memory.graph\": { \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"config\": { \"instance\": \"infra-ops\" } }, \"&time.anomaly\": { \"provider\": \"ticktickclock\", \"config\": { \"streams\": [\"cpu\", \"mem\"] } }, \"&space.fleet\": { \"provider\": \"geofleetic\", \"config\": { \"regions\": [\"us-east\"] } }, \"&reason.argument\": { \"provider\": \"deliberatic\", \"config\": { \"governance\": \"constitutional\" } } }, \"provenance\": true } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8325","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8173","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8326","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8174","text":"9. Example API shape"}]},{"id":"blk-8327","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8175","text":"A provider-specific API may vary, but the protocol-level shape can look like this."}]},{"id":"blk-8328","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8176","text":"Recall request"}]},{"id":"blk-8329","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8177","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.graph\", \"operation\": \"recall\", \"input\": { \"query_context\": { \"incident_type\": \"cpu_spike\", \"region\": \"us-east\", \"service\": \"api-gateway\" } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8330","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8178","text":"Recall response"}]},{"id":"blk-8331","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8179","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.graph\", \"operation\": \"recall\", \"output\": { \"memory_hits\": [ { \"entity\": \"incident-4821\", \"summary\": \"CPU saturation on api-gateway during regional traffic spike\", \"links\": [\"service:api-gateway\", \"region:us-east\", \"runbook:scale-gateway\"] }, { \"entity\": \"incident-4792\", \"summary\": \"Dependency saturation caused by cache failure\", \"links\": [\"service:cache\", \"service:api-gateway\"] } ] } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8332","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8180","text":"Enrich request"}]},{"id":"blk-8333","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8181","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.graph\", \"operation\": \"enrich\", \"input\": { \"anomaly_set\": { \"service\": \"api-gateway\", \"region\": \"us-east\", \"anomalies\": [\"cpu_spike\", \"latency_jump\"] } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8334","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8182","text":"Enrich response"}]},{"id":"blk-8335","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8183","text":"~~~json { \"capability\": \"&memory.graph\", \"operation\": \"enrich\", \"output\": { \"enriched_context\": { \"related_incidents\": [\"incident-4821\", \"incident-4792\"], \"related_entities\": [\"service:cache\", \"service:api-gateway\", \"region:us-east\"], \"suggested_runbooks\": [\"scale-gateway\", \"check-cache-health\"] } } } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8336","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8184","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8337","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8185","text":"10. Compatible providers"}]},{"id":"blk-8338","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8186","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8187","text":" is a capability interface. Compatible providers are implementations that can satisfy the contract."}]},{"id":"blk-8339","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8188","text":"Representative providers:"}]},{"id":"blk-8340","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8342","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8189","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous"}]}],"id":"blk-8341","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8344","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8190","marks":["code"],"text":"neo4j-memory"}]}],"id":"blk-8343","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8346","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8191","text":"custom graph-backed MCP services"}]}],"id":"blk-8345","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8348","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8192","text":"domain-specific knowledge graph systems wrapped behind a protocol-compatible surface"}]}],"id":"blk-8347","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8349","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8193","text":"Current default ecosystem fit"}]},{"id":"blk-8350","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8352","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8194","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous"},{"id":"spn-8195","text":" is the clearest default example provider in this repository"}]}],"id":"blk-8351","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8196","text":"Why it fits:"}]},{"id":"blk-8354","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8356","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8197","text":"graph-oriented memory model"}]}],"id":"blk-8355","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8358","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8198","text":"MCP-friendly runtime shape"}]}],"id":"blk-8357","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8360","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8199","text":"suitable for recall, enrichment, and learning workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-8359","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8362","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8200","text":"directly useful for infra, research, and agent memory scenarios"}]}],"id":"blk-8361","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8363","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8201","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8364","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8202","text":"11. A2A-facing skills"}]},{"id":"blk-8365","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8203","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-8204","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8205","text":" capability may advertise skills such as:"}]},{"id":"blk-8366","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8368","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8206","marks":["code"],"text":"graph-memory-recall"}]}],"id":"blk-8367","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8370","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8207","marks":["code"],"text":"context-enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-8369","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8372","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8208","marks":["code"],"text":"memory-consolidation"}]}],"id":"blk-8371","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8373","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8209","text":"These skills are useful when generating A2A agent cards from a declaration, because they let an externally visible agent surface say more than just “has memory.”"}]},{"id":"blk-8374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8210","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8375","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8211","text":"12. Governance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-8376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8212","text":"Graph memory often sits close to high-value historical context, so governance matters."}]},{"id":"blk-8377","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8213","text":"Examples of governance constraints that commonly pair with "},{"id":"spn-8214","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8215","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-8378","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8216","text":"Hard constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-8379","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8217","text":"never reveal private customer-linked graph context outside authorized workflows"}]}],"id":"blk-8380","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8383","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8218","text":"never delete incident lineage without human approval"}]}],"id":"blk-8382","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8219","text":"always preserve audit trail for graph-backed decision support"}]}],"id":"blk-8384","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8386","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8220","text":"Soft constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-8387","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8389","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8221","text":"prefer policy-grounded linked evidence over unsupported inference"}]}],"id":"blk-8388","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8391","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8222","text":"prefer recent validated graph context when conflicts exist"}]}],"id":"blk-8390","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8392","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8223","text":"Escalation triggers"}]},{"id":"blk-8393","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8224","text":"escalate when confidence in recalled graph context is below threshold"}]}],"id":"blk-8394","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8397","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8225","text":"escalate when a decision depends on sparse or conflicting graph evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-8396","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8226","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8399","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8227","text":"13. Provenance implications"}]},{"id":"blk-8400","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8228","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8229","text":" should participate in the provenance chain."}]},{"id":"blk-8401","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8230","text":"Representative provenance record:"}]},{"id":"blk-8402","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8231","text":"~~~json { \"source\": \"&memory.graph\", \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"operation\": \"enrich\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-14T14:23:07Z\", \"input_hash\": \"sha256:1a2b...\", \"output_hash\": \"sha256:7c8d...\", \"parent_hash\": \"sha256:0000...\" } ~~~"}]},{"id":"blk-8403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8232","text":"This matters because graph-backed context often strongly influences downstream reasoning. If a system chooses a remediation path because graph memory linked the current issue to prior incidents, that enrichment step should be auditable."}]},{"id":"blk-8404","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8233","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8405","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8234","text":"14. Typical use cases"}]},{"id":"blk-8406","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8235","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8236","text":" is especially strong in the following domains."}]},{"id":"blk-8407","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8237","text":"Infrastructure operations"}]},{"id":"blk-8408","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8238","text":"dependency-aware incident recall"}]}],"id":"blk-8409","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8412","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8239","text":"similar outage enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-8411","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8414","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8240","text":"durable operational knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-8413","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8416","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8241","text":"continual learning from postmortems"}]}],"id":"blk-8415","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8417","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8242","text":"Research systems"}]},{"id":"blk-8418","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8243","text":"linked concepts and citations"}]}],"id":"blk-8419","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8244","text":"claim/evidence relationship structure"}]}],"id":"blk-8421","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8245","text":"durable research graph building"}]}],"id":"blk-8423","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8425","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8246","text":"Customer support"}]},{"id":"blk-8426","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8247","text":"account and case relationship modeling"}]}],"id":"blk-8427","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8248","text":"escalation lineage"}]}],"id":"blk-8429","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8432","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8249","text":"policy and entity linkage across prior interactions"}]}],"id":"blk-8431","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8433","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8250","text":"Fraud and investigation"}]},{"id":"blk-8434","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8436","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8251","text":"entity graph traversal"}]}],"id":"blk-8435","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8438","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8252","text":"linked device/account/session analysis"}]}],"id":"blk-8437","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8253","text":"relationship-based anomaly support"}]}],"id":"blk-8439","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8254","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8442","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8255","text":"15. Anti-patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-8443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8256","text":"Avoid these mistakes when modeling "},{"id":"spn-8257","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8258","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-8444","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8259","text":"Anti-pattern 1: treating graph memory as just another vector store"}]},{"id":"blk-8445","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8260","text":"Graph memory is valuable because of structure, not just similarity."}]},{"id":"blk-8446","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8261","text":"Anti-pattern 2: collapsing provider and capability"}]},{"id":"blk-8447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8262","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous"},{"id":"spn-8263","text":" is not the protocol capability. "},{"id":"spn-8264","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8265","text":" is."}]},{"id":"blk-8448","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8266","text":"Anti-pattern 3: using graph memory without provenance"}]},{"id":"blk-8449","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8267","text":"If graph-linked context influences action, lineage should be preserved."}]},{"id":"blk-8450","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8268","text":"Anti-pattern 4: using graph memory for everything"}]},{"id":"blk-8451","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8269","text":"Not every retrieval problem is best solved by graph structure alone. In many systems, "},{"id":"spn-8270","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8271","text":" works best alongside "},{"id":"spn-8272","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8273","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-8274","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"},{"id":"spn-8275","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-8452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8276","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8453","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8277","text":"16. Related capabilities"}]},{"id":"blk-8454","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8278","text":"Closest related protocol capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-8455","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8457","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8279","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"}]}],"id":"blk-8456","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8459","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8280","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.episodic"}]}],"id":"blk-8458","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8281","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-8460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8282","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"}]}],"id":"blk-8462","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8283","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"}]}],"id":"blk-8464","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8284","text":"Common high-value compositions:"}]},{"id":"blk-8467","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8285","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-8286","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8287","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8288","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8289","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-8468","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8471","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8290","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8291","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8292","marks":["code"],"text":"&space.fleet"},{"id":"spn-8293","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8294","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.plan"}]}],"id":"blk-8470","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8295","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8296","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8297","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.vector"},{"id":"spn-8298","text":" + "},{"id":"spn-8299","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason.argument"}]}],"id":"blk-8472","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8474","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8300","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8475","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8301","text":"17. Research references"}]},{"id":"blk-8476","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8302","text":"This capability is informed by both memory-systems research and modern agent memory architecture work."}]},{"id":"blk-8477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8303","text":"Useful reference directions:"}]},{"id":"blk-8478","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8480","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8304","text":"Atkinson & Shiffrin — staged memory models"}]}],"id":"blk-8479","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8482","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8305","text":"Endel Tulving — episodic vs semantic memory distinction"}]}],"id":"blk-8481","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8484","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8306","text":"Alan Baddeley — working memory and active memory use"}]}],"id":"blk-8483","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8486","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8307","text":"Larry Squire and related memory-systems research"}]}],"id":"blk-8485","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8488","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8308","text":"modern knowledge graph and graph retrieval systems"}]}],"id":"blk-8487","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8490","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8309","text":"graph-based agent memory architectures"}]}],"id":"blk-8489","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8310","text":"retrieval-augmented reasoning systems with structured memory"}]}],"id":"blk-8491","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8493","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8311","text":"The protocol does not claim to reproduce neuroscience literally. The value of these references is that they support treating memory as a family of functions rather than one monolithic feature."}]},{"id":"blk-8494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8312","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-8495","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-8313","text":"18. Summary"}]},{"id":"blk-8496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8314","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8315","text":" is the [&] Protocol capability for graph-structured memory."}]},{"id":"blk-8497","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8316","text":"It is the right capability when an agent needs:"}]},{"id":"blk-8498","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8317","text":"durable structured recall"}]}],"id":"blk-8499","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8318","text":"relationship-aware enrichment"}]}],"id":"blk-8501","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8319","text":"connected incident or research context"}]}],"id":"blk-8503","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8506","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8320","text":"continual learning into linked knowledge"}]}],"id":"blk-8505","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8321","text":"explainable memory that preserves structure"}]}],"id":"blk-8507","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8509","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8322","text":"In one sentence:"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8323","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-8324","text":" lets an agent remember not only facts, but how those facts connect."}]}],"id":"blk-8510","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-8512","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-8325","text":"---"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraa26pfvfx7wethvr7djf6g5rwukzpfq4unhb5tlf4cqg7pzhqmtrq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}